                                "sense_id": "24deaf20-06b4-371b-994a-e01bb23c7f27",
                                "text": "Chang Chen-wei (章宸瑋), a second-year high school student, said he learned a lot from the American participants, whom he said \"did not just come here to compete.\"\nDescribing the local teams as valuing more than just wins and losses, Chang said he was impressed by their collaboration and enjoyment of the process, which allowed them to showcase their individual talents."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
